Falsifies `designware_ethernet::proofs::an_mdio_command_word_keeps_each_address_in_its_own_field`.

The defect: the command word no longer reduces the register address to five bits, so a register address above 31 spills into the PHY address field and addresses a different PHY.

Expected to fail: the harness's check that the PHY address field equals the PHY address masked to five bits, on any register address with a bit above bit 4.

